{"4775990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Puppetry", "steam_appid": 4775990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppetry is a 3D puzzle-mystery adventure where you play as a haunted voodoo doll trapped inside a mysterious mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stripped of its power and bound by dark magic, the doll must explore the mansion’s shifting halls, uncover hidden secrets, and recover its lost voodoo pins to regain its abilities. Each reclaimed pin unlocks new magical powers, allowing you to manipulate objects, solve environmental puzzles, and reveal the mansion’s buried truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chase Burdin — Lead Designer and Producer</i><br><i>Maya Patten — Producer</i><br><i>Jasper Vergo — Gameplay Programming &amp; Technical Artist</i><br><i>Jason Chen — Programmer &amp; Level Designer</i><br><i>Charlie Schmerzler — Level Designer</i><br><i>Thomas Hefferan - Level Designer</i><br><i>Daria Prewitt — Writer</i><br><i>Maggie Ulto — Sound Design &amp; Music</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Artists:</i><br><i>Ren Grunberg — Art Lead: Environments and Props</i><br><i>Marietta I Rivera Sigmann — 3D Modeler and Texture Artist</i><br><i>Anthony Panasenko — Modeler, Rigger &amp; Animator</i><br><i>Elisa Luna Cameron — 3D Texture Artist</i><br><i>John de Andrade — Concept and 2D Artist</i><br><i>Sarah Nim — UI Designer and 2D Artist</i><br><i>Shark Da Silva — Concept &amp; 2D Artist</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Voice Actors:</i><br><i>Camilla Vitola-Franchi — Voice Actor: Doll</i><br><i>Christian Drapeau — Voice Actor: Narrator and Ghost</i><br><i>Sammi Bosque — Voice Actor: Ghost</i><br><i>Rachel Harvie — Voice Actor: Ghost</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puppetry is a 3D puzzle-mystery adventure where you play as a haunted voodoo doll trapped inside a mysterious mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stripped of its power and bound by dark magic, the doll must explore the mansion’s shifting halls, uncover hidden secrets, and recover its lost voodoo pins to regain its abilities. Each reclaimed pin unlocks new magical powers, allowing you to manipulate objects, solve environmental puzzles, and reveal the mansion’s buried truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Credits:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Chase Burdin — Lead Designer and Producer</i><br><i>Maya Patten — Producer</i><br><i>Jasper Vergo — Gameplay Programming &amp; Technical Artist</i><br><i>Jason Chen — Programmer &amp; Level Designer</i><br><i>Charlie Schmerzler — Level Designer</i><br><i>Thomas Hefferan - Level Designer</i><br><i>Daria Prewitt — Writer</i><br><i>Maggie Ulto — Sound Design &amp; Music</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Artists:</i><br><i>Ren Grunberg — Art Lead: Environments and Props</i><br><i>Marietta I Rivera Sigmann — 3D Modeler and Texture Artist</i><br><i>Anthony Panasenko — Modeler, Rigger &amp; Animator</i><br><i>Elisa Luna Cameron — 3D Texture Artist</i><br><i>John de Andrade — Concept and 2D Artist</i><br><i>Sarah Nim — UI Designer and 2D Artist</i><br><i>Shark Da Silva — Concept &amp; 2D Artist</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Voice Actors:</i><br><i>Camilla Vitola-Franchi — Voice Actor: Doll</i><br><i>Christian Drapeau — Voice Actor: Narrator and Ghost</i><br><i>Sammi Bosque — Voice Actor: Ghost</i><br><i>Rachel Harvie — Voice Actor: Ghost</i></p>", "short_description": "Puppetry is a 3D puzzle-mystery adventure where you play as a haunted voodoo doll trapped inside a mysterious mansion.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4775990/d6dc00f01b4a2ac196a4dc9d584a53eb6a88b343/header.jpg?t=1787320505", "capsule_image": "https://